The inheriting using-declaration set found_ctor, which suppressed the
implicit default constructor, and a POD-like class got none at all; now
neither does ([dcl.init.aggr]/1.1: such a class is not an aggregate).  g++
13 and clang++ 18 accept this program, and it fails only its WRONG
assertion.
